<title>FRANCE: Coflexip down after share placement.</title>
<headline>Coflexip down after share placement.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in off-shore engineering company Coflexip were down 3.6 percent at 321 francs after an important share placement carried out by brokers CDC Bourse, dealers said.</p>
<p>CDC Bourse confirmed it a statement it had successfully placed shares with French and international investors after market close on Tuesday but it did not give the size or the price of the placement.</p>
<p>A fund manager said the placement was done at 314 francs per share and some dealers said SCOR was the seller.</p>
<p>There was no immediate comment from SCOR or Coflexip.</p>
</text>
